Project scope
-------------

This repository implements the DeepSeek Harness companion plugin (`dsh-beeftv`):
host/client workspace bridging, local BeefTV IPC handshake, MCP tool approval,
and generation completion wake-up state machines. When packaged for standalone
use via `package-runtime.mjs`, `runtime/` embeds executables and assets built
from `glanderness/BeefTV`, which retain their own notices.

Upstream source (bundled BeefTV runtime)
----------------------------------------

The bundled BeefTV runtime contains code derived from the following upstream
projects:

  Infinite Canvas
  https://github.com/basketikun/infinite-canvas
  Base version: v0.5.0
  Base commit: 568f0f1838df8de31fe885a4e130e2f346dd14ab

Infinite Canvas, maintained by basketikun, provides the upstream infinite
canvas architecture and portions of the canvas implementation used by BeefTV,
including node dragging and zooming, connections, undo/redo, and canvas
import/export. The project was relicensed to MIT in commit
890ba95858bbb13496d23978003716656109abb2. Its copyright and permission notice
are preserved in Part B of LICENSE.

  影策 Open AI Canvas (ddcat-ai/open-ai-canvas)
