BeefTV-DSH and bundled runtime changes
--------------------------------------

- BeefTV-DSH plugin (this repository): adds and maintains the DeepSeek Harness
  host/client integration, local workspace IPC discovery, MCP permission gates,
  and durable task wait/wake orchestration.
- Bundled BeefTV runtime (`glanderness/BeefTV`): adapts and extends the
  upstream workspace into a local single-user desktop runtime, including the
  Wails desktop shell, local SQLite and asset workspace isolation, the durable
  Pi-based Agent runtime, and expanded media, provider, and UI capabilities.

